": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PvdEW3Zc9vkQ7kNvwFoFI6F&_nc_oc=Adpos3Sd20OzYjvjK6udC-7iqUmDT1g5Lvbj4XTLBLzyBiK3fXJk0M6aiVp1OwUjUBg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNk0YlHW5uGak9IBc8wGatLecCcd6bvfIORXR7e3RZgNQ&oe=6AE0CC1B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ArT9pnTXW3EQ7kNvwHNgGRu&_nc_oc=AdrkLXwE8kg9YbssGfgOu_0sLGmdcdXIPD9_-e7DeMlZjghs8dNytznzJ4exsFvgWOE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMvmLdxi5nMmGb1y1Ka7KPyXgyuP-iih2NuoaYAvujiMA&oe=6AE0BC61"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VnGN1u-ZpSwQ7kNvwFjqGfw&_nc_oc=AdrH4r_03tQw6_oc__EPsJRp1Zo9vdC4GpfkNIC0rYlCijW44IdcFgXXMgZlU_BMCns&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOZGH7xgRDcbJlrQo8J1jq2ek5o5duWLouXhxo5Cg88tw&oe=6AE0A92F"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WZa-op2xqcEQ7kNvwGpEHMA&_nc_oc=Adq8EM0twrwzB-eDqakeoSjG9OhLBL16JiPtzrHvXqkFBzAETXSl6ARE9D55WOptiX0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPugW8reG3wNxMXqiprl_9ZdNbuNHHQ4hz0gkMjXtylZw&oe=6AE0A8D2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oMLCvGmLvSUQ7kNvwGsV8IG&_nc_oc=AdozzMG4LcduZN2uN-mNPwx34YQwQNCThKS0G_gi_3Me8vsi6u3aNQfaJhrHj2ANkdU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPjwykyxUfIzDGh7mk9CIlU4uzDlSN4bX92J845ZiSLYQ&oe=6AE0B27D"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a